.TH DANBY-SWING1 1
.SH NAME
danby-swing1 \- pump a swing by changing centre of mass
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B swing1
.SH DESCRIPTION
This model changes the effective pendulum length twice per pumping cycle.  The
radial motion contributes the exact two-times-length-rate angular-velocity term,
so timing determines whether the child adds or removes energy.
.PP
The diagram and live angle/speed plot expose the motion.  Click a parameter
scale to change it, space pauses, period steps while paused, R resets, and Q exits.
